<title>MOROCCO: SOCCER-MOROCCO'S KAWKAB MARRAKESH WIN CAF CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MOROCCO'S KAWKAB MARRAKESH WIN CAF CUP.</headline>
<dateline>MARRAKESH, Morocco 1996-11-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's Kawkab of</p>
<p>Marrakesh won the Confederation of African Football (CAF) Cup on</p>
<p>Saturday when they beat Etoile Sportive du Sahel of Tunisia 2-0</p>
<p>(halftime 2-0) in the final.</p>
<p>Scorers: Kaddaoui Amarani (15), Hicham Dimiai (44)</p>
<p>Attendance: 50,000</p>
<p>Etoile Sportive du Sahel won the first leg in Tunisia 3-1.</p>
<p>Aggregate score 3-3. Kawkab win on away goals rule.</p>
</text>
